Summary of changes made to dsh-image-gen 0.11.2: renamed package, ids, routes, tool names and storage; removed the
inspiration library, GIF sprite-sheet handling and the Seedream, DashScope, Zhipu and ChatGPT-subscription providers;
translated the UI and error strings to English; removed the tldraw-based infinite canvas (and its tools, routes and dependency); moved the studio UI into a lazily loaded chunk; replaced the build
with the dsh-kit template; added the v2 provider layer, job queue, library with lineage, video, inpaint/outpaint, upscaling
and the HyperFrames hand-off.

